# Uploaded audio. Content-addressed and reproducible; never committed.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored, `storage/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth — which silently excluded the source
# module apps/api/src/storage/ from the repository, so a fresh clone could not
# build. Only a clone test catches that; every local check passes regardless.
/storage/

# Prisma 7 generates a TypeScript client into the source tree.
